    [240147]={status="ok",name="Heretic Handguards",quality=4,tip="Sanctified\nItem Level 98\nBinds when picked up\nHands\nCloth\n91 Armor\n+31 Stamina\n+10 Spirit\n+130 Armor\nDurability 35 / 35\nClasses: Warlock\nRequires Level 60\nEquip: Increased Defense +15.\nEquip: Improves your chance to get a critical strike by 1.0%.\nEquip: Increases damage and healing done by magical spells and effects by up to 15.\nHeretic Stitchings (0/8)\nHeretic Hood\nHeretic Mantle\nHeretic Waistguard\nHeretic Pants\nHeretic Boots\nHeretic Wristguards\nHeretic Handguards\nHeretic Garb\n(2) Set : Your Shadow Cleave now applies your Corruption Rank 7 to every target it hits but its duration is only 12 sec.\n(4) Set : You heal for 10% of all damage done by your Corruption. This healing is increased to 100% if the target is also afflicted with your Drain Life.\n(6) Set : Your Infernal Armor now also increases all magical damage you deal by 20% and lasts an additional 10 sec.\nSell Price: 5 30 23"},
