    [260802]={status="ok",name="EZ-Thro Bronze Mortar",quality=1,tip="Item Level 39\nBinds when equipped\nUnique-Equipped\nTrinket\nUse: Inflicts 85 to 115 Fire damage and stuns targets in a 5 yd radius for 2 sec. Any damage will break the effect. (10 Min Cooldown)\n8 Charges\n\"Thro mo mo tar!\"\nSell Price: 20"},
    [260806]={status="ok",name="Emergency Field Cloak",quality=1,tip="Item Level 40\nBinds when picked up\nUnique-Equipped\nTrinket\nUse: Gives invisibility for 10 sec. (1 Hour Cooldown)\n3 Charges\n\"SAF-T means not getting caught.\"\nSell Price: 50"},
    [260810]={status="ok",name="SAF-T Disposable Parachute",quality=1,tip="Item Level 50\nBinds when equipped\nBack\n31 Armor\nUse: Reduces your fall speed for 10 sec. (30 Min Cooldown)\n3 Charges\n\"SAF-T in case you need to jump.\"\nSell Price: 46 96"},
    [260819]={status="ok",name="EZ-Thro Field Transporter: Gadgetzan",quality=2,tip="Item Level 60\nBinds when used\nUnique-Equipped\nTrinket\nRequires Level 55\nUse: Safely transport yourself to Gadgetzan in Tanaris! Emphasis on Safe! Yup, nothing bad could ever happen while using this device! (4 Hrs Cooldown)\n3 Charges\nSell Price: 50"},
    [260820]={status="ok",name="SAF-T Emergency Ripper: Everlook",quality=2,tip="Item Level 60\nBinds when used\nUnique-Equipped\nTrinket\nRequires Level 55\nUse: Rips the dimensional walls asunder and transports you to Everlook in Winterspring. There are technical problems that sometimes occur, but that's what Goblin Engineering is all about! (4 Hrs Cooldown)\n3 Charges\nSell Price: 50"},
    [260821]={status="ok",name="EZ and SAF Field Transporter: Mt. Hyjal",quality=2,tip="Item Level 60\nBinds when used\nUnique-Equipped\nTrinket\nRequires Level 60\nUse: Rips the dimensional walls asunder and transports you to Kaylaena's Workshop on Mount Hyjal. Technical problems have a high chance to occur with this mad combination of goblin and gnomish engineering. (4 Hrs Cooldown)\n3 Charges\n\"Not only combining Goblin and Gnome tech, but also combining plans from the EZ-Thro and SAF-T corporations. Who knows if this will even work?\"\nSell Price: 50"},
    [260824]={status="ok",name="Gnomish Poultryizer",quality=3,tip="Item Level 60\nBinds when picked up\nUnique-Equipped\nTrinket\nRequires Level 60\nUse: Turns the target into a chicken for 15 sec. Well, that is assuming the transmogrification polarity has not been reversed... (5 Min Cooldown)\nSell Price: 50"},
    [260828]={status="ok",name="SAF-T Nitro Boosts",quality=2,tip="Item Level 60\nBinds when equipped\nWaist\nCloth\n44 Armor\nRequires Level 55\nUse: Activate a set of jets to increase your movement speed by up to 160%, for up to 8 sec.\n3 Charges\n\"Rocket to safety with SAF-T.\"\nSell Price: 12 50"},
    [260829]={status="ok",name="EZ-Thro Magnetic Displacer",quality=2,tip="Item Level 60\nBinds when equipped\nWaist\nCloth\n44 Armor\nRequires Level 55\nUse: Disrupt a magnetic field between you and your nearby enemy target, knocking you both away.\nCan only affect targets up to 2 levels higher than you. Some targets cannot be displaced. Targets can only be affected by this effect once every 2 min.\n3 Charges\n\"EZ-Thro corporation not responsible for magnets preventing grenades from being thrown.\"\nSell Price: 12 50"},
    [260830]={status="ok",name="SAF-T Teleport",quality=2,tip="Item Level 60\nBinds when equipped\nWaist\nRequires Level 55\nUse: Teleport forward 20 yds.\n3 Charges\n\"Teleport to SAF-T!\"\nSell Price: 12 50"},
